From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eight <eight@localhost>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] ASoC: amd: acp3x-es83xx: add Huawei MateBook D14 AMD
 (NBM-WXX9)

The Huawei MateBook D14 AMD laptop (DMI product name NBM-WXX9, product
version M1020) uses the same ESS ES8336 codec wiring as the existing
HVY-WXX9/M1020 (MateBook D14/D15 2022) entries: the internal microphone
is connected through the ACP PDM controller and is selected by the
ES83XX_ENABLE_DMIC quirk.

Register the board in acp3x_es83xx_dmi_table[] so the machine driver
accepts it instead of failing with -ENODEV.

Signed-off-by: Eight <eight@localhost>
---
 sound/soc/amd/acp/acp3x-es83xx/acp3x-es83xx.c       |  8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/sound/soc/amd/acp/acp3x-es83xx/acp3x-es83xx.c b/sound/soc/amd/acp/acp3x-es83xx/acp3x-es83xx.c
--- a/sound/soc/amd/acp/acp3x-es83xx/acp3x-es83xx.c
+++ b/sound/soc/amd/acp/acp3x-es83xx/acp3x-es83xx.c
@@ -382,6 +382,14 @@
 		},
 		.driver_data = (void *)(ES83XX_ENABLE_DMIC),
 	},
+	{
+		.matches = {
+			DMI_EXACT_MATCH(DMI_BOARD_VENDOR, "HUAWEI"),
+			DMI_EXACT_MATCH(DMI_PRODUCT_NAME, "NBM-WXX9"),
+			DMI_EXACT_MATCH(DMI_PRODUCT_VERSION, "M1020"),
+		},
+		.driver_data = (void *)(ES83XX_ENABLE_DMIC | ES83XX_48_MHZ_MCLK),
+	},
 	{}
 };
 
